OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel 'to close within
OL,4,Aweeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel in Warwick will no longer be
OL,7,Fused to house asylum seekers from early
OL,8,Fnext year, an MP has said.
OL,10,FThe Delta Hotel, on Stratford Road,
OL,11,Ffirst shut to the public and was
OL,12,Frepurposed to house asylum seekers in
OL,13,FNovember 2024.
OL,15,FMatt Western, MP for Warwick and
OL,16,FLeamington, said he received
OL,17,Fconfirmation from the Home Office
OL,18,Ffollowing several meetings and
OL,19,Fcorrespondence with officials
OL,20,Frequesting it should be closed.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
