OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel 'to close within
OL,4,Aweeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Home Office spokesperson said: "We
OL,7,Fare working to fairly house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers across the country while
OL,9,Fengaging closely with local authorities
OL,10,Fto minimise impacts on communities."
